  "E-1": "thin eval_d0d1.py instead of 'eval_geo2.py run --rungs geo' and instead of a new evaluate.py e3: it imports analysis/d1_ladder/evaluate.py unchanged and calls its E2 functions (fu2_eval, prep_S, read_lab, label_info, model_frames, check_pair_attrs, ref_set, derived_frames, gate_pairs, check_line, annotate_all, metrics_e1, met_index, bends_e1, goal_e1) on rung geo, and eval_geo2 metrics / reps / select / app_metrics / by_class / goal; LADDER outputs are untouched (no LADDER file is written or edited)",
  "E-2": "REP / REP8 / ENS4 from the geo unit records val_kcal_mae (L_report_geo.json + L_xgb_report_geo.json; T1D0 inner validation = D1 only) before the prediction file is read; the D0 rows use the same choices",
  "E-3": "LINE of the geo rung = the SH units' baseline column (base = beta x dH as trained; T1D0 fits beta on its own training pairs), checked equal across the 4 SH models and zero for S (LADDER check_line); no input-table recomputation (the stage-3 LINE of the trainer is the reference); null = 0",
  "E-4": "D1 rows = every non-'d0' row (pair ids of S_folds.csv); D0 rows = ref_kind 'd0' (pair ids of D0_pairs.csv); the two id sets must agree, unknown ids = STOP",
  "E-5": "D0 evaluation pairs = predicted D0 pairs with D0_pairs.csv ok true (label eligibility); predicted not-ok pairs are counted and left out; the pair fold must equal d0_folds.csv of both ends (else STOP: leakage)",
  "E-6": "D0 CI = component bootstrap (component = D0_pairs.csv core 'D0/<component>', 2,000 resamples, seed 20261019; = eval_geo2.boot_diff(e, 0, component) with the resampling weights cached per component list)",
  "E-7": "D0 subsets all and no_m1_twin (neither end has a stereo-free D1 twin of T1 fold -1, d0_twins.csv m1; DECISIONS_PAIR P-y-m1 recommendation); edge kinds all / sibling / dipole / leaf",
  "E-8": "no verdict, no g2 / dft rows or columns; eval_geo2.py run (the GEO2 comparison) is disabled under D0D1"
 },
